Package: flowgate
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: busybox, lighttpd, lighttpd-mod-proxy, lighttpd-mod-rewrite, lighttpd-mod-setenv, lighttpd-mod-deflate
Section: net
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Xpymb <https://github.com/Xpymb>
URL: https://github.com/Xpymb/FlowGate
Description: Xray manager for Keenetic with WebUI: subscriptions, socks/http/wireguard connections, DNS routes by domain lists
